OL,3,GNEWSACyclist killed in crash 'was
OL,4,Adeeply caring'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a
OL,7,F16-year-old cyclist who suffered fatal
OL,8,Finjuries when he was hit by a car in
OL,9,FBirmingham.
OL,11,FMuhammad Ismail Alum died in hospital
OL,12,Fon Saturday after the crash at the
OL,13,Fjunction of Cattell Road and
OL,14,FTemplefield Street, Small Heath, on 28
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FThe teenager's deputy head teacher at
OL,18,FDarul Uloom Islamic High School said he
OL,19,Fwas "a remarkable young man", who was
OL,20,F"respectful, resilient, responsible and
OL,21,Fdeeply caring".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
