OL,3,GNEWSACyclist killed in crash 'was
OL,4,Adeeply caring'
OL,5,
OL,6,FClyde Carey, 47, has been charged with
OL,7,Fcausing Alum's death by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving, failing to stop at the scene
OL,9,Fand causing death while uninsured, West
OL,10,FMidlands Police said. He appeared
OL,11,Fbefore city magistrates on Monday.
